[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0616","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0616.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0830","title":"SCO UnixWare 7.0/7.0.1/7.1 Xsco 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.0、7.0.1 及 7.1 版本中自带的 Xsco 程序存在基于堆栈的缓冲区溢出漏洞。该产品以 root 权限运行，本地普通用户可通过构造超长的命令行参数触发溢出，覆盖返回地址并执行任意代码，从而提升自身权限至 root，危害系统安全。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0830"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"1999-10-08T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 SCO 官方发布的安全补丁（如 UnixWare 7 的 ptf 包），或升级至已修复该问题的 UnixWare 7.1.1 及后续版本。临时措施可移除 Xsco 程序的 setuid root 位权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T15:26:05Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0830","https://www.securityfocus.com/bid/736"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19498"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0616.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1064","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1347","title":"Red Hat Linux Xsession 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.1 及更早版本中的 Xsession 存在安全绕过漏洞，本地受限用户可通过 kdm 启动 KDE、GNOME 等桌面环境，绕过系统对 .xsession 文件的执行限制，从而以非预期权限运行任意脚本或配置，造成未授权访问。攻击者需具有本地系统账户并能登录图形界面，即可触发该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1347"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:14Z","remediation":"升级 Red Hat Linux 至 6.2 及以上版本。如无法升级，可移除受限用户的 kdm 登录权限，编辑 /etc/kdm/kdmrc 配置限制 kdm 会话启动类型，或直接禁用 kdm 改用文本终端登录。由于 Red Hat Linux 6.x 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的企业级 Linux 发行版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93942774609925&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1347.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1347","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1347.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1347.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1347.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/911f5a223608d942c4f7bd1db06939fd49c06258/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-13xx/CVE-1999-1347.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f6d52b4e60097d0b1e22946a714605a3221782fc/1999/CVE-1999-1347.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/27bda0043c24e3a60635efaebd455bc46f911f61/api/1999/CVE-1999-1347.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1347.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1347.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1063","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1346","title":"Red Hat Linux rlogin PAM 配置认证绕过漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.1及更早版本中rlogin服务的PAM配置文件存在规则顺序缺陷，限制性较弱的规则被置于限制性较强的规则之前，导致即使管理员通过/etc/nologin文件明确禁用了rlogin服务，攻击者仍可利用该配置缺陷通过rlogin协议远程访问目标主机，造成安全绕过。该漏洞影响Red Hat Linux 6.1及更早版本，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1346"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:14Z","remediation":"升级 Red Hat Linux 至 6.2 或更高版本。如无法升级，编辑 /etc/pam.d/rlogin 配置文件，将 pam_nologin.so 规则移至 pam_rhosts_auth.so 等宽松规则之前，确保先检查 /etc/nologin 文件。同时限制 /etc/hosts.equiv 和 .rhosts 文件的使用范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93942774609925&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/63f7cdb3d3ebf7bfe8ef6a2325af30a024b23325/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1346.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1346","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1346.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/175fba1f481a7f7cf5bdb5344d3c0e47af1884ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1346.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5x42-xxxg-rqpp/GHSA-5x42-xxxg-rqpp.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1346.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87886/info.html","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8eedf1cb11548f43d573399be49eeffcf4f32e25/1999.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--d32e64ec-7a3f-48d0-b1ff-6af6d43774c9.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1346","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1346.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1346","title":"Red Hat Linux PAM rlogin 配置绕过认证漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.0 及 6.1 版本中 PAM 配置文件 /etc/pam.d/rlogin 的规则顺序存在缺陷，pam_rhosts_auth.so 的 sufficient 规则位于 pam_nologin.so 的 required 规则之前，导致即使管理员通过 /etc/nologin 文件禁用了 rlogin 登录，远程攻击者仍可利用 rhosts 认证机制绕过限制访问系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1346"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-10-07T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"修改 /etc/pam.d/rlogin 配置文件，将 pam_nologin.so 的 required 规则移至 pam_rhosts_auth.so 的 sufficient 规则之前，确保 nologin 检查优先执行。升级至 Red Hat Linux 6.2 或更高版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93942774609925&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1346.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1158","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1158.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1522","title":"Roxen Web Server htmlparse.pike 递归解析和 RXML referer 标签漏洞","description":"Roxen Web Server 1.3.11 及更早版本中的 htmlparse.pike 模块存在递归解析漏洞。RXML 解析器采用递归机制处理标签，但 <referer> 标签的代码未对客户端输入的 Referer HTTP 头进行正确转义或阻止进一步递归解析，导致远程攻击者可通过发送构造了恶意 Referer 头的 HTTP 请求触发无限递归解析，造成服务器资源耗尽（拒绝服务）。该漏洞影响所有启用了 Pike-tag 或 RXML 解析器的 Roxen Web Server 实例，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS v2.0 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），厂商已于 1999 年 10 月发布补丁修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1522"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-07T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-10-07T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Roxen Web Server 至 1.3.12 或更高版本，或应用官方补丁修改 htmlparse.pike 中 referer 标签处理逻辑：将 `return sizeof(id->referer)?id->referer*\"\":m->alt?m->alt:\"..\";` 改为 `return sizeof(id->referer)?({ id->referer*\"\" }):m->alt?m->alt:\"..\";`，用数组包裹返回值防止递归解析注入。临时缓解措施可禁用 RXML 解析器及 Pike-tag 功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4441343672f486c63736487674c197dfd2a4f256/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1522.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1522","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1522.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/81cdfffcd86317dec05d7dfba407f93d96d91273/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1522.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3vpv-5wr7-2hx5/GHSA-3vpv-5wr7-2hx5.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1522.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000819.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/92476fa9ef5bbdf211d346519c4e7fa1edfdfea0/1999.tsv","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1158.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1158.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1158.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1066","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1349","title":"Xlink Technology Omni-NFS/X Enterprise 6.1 NFS Daemon TCP URG 数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Xlink Technology 公司 Omni-NFS X Enterprise 6.1 版本中的 NFS 守护进程 nfsd.exe 存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的 111 端口发送设置了 URG（紧急）标志的畸形 TCP 数据包，导致服务端资源耗尽，从而使 NFS 服务不可用。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可远程触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1349"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:15Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Xlink Technology Omni-NFS/X Enterprise 6.1 及更早版本，该产品已长期停止维护。建议立即迁移至其他受支持的 NFS 服务器方案（如 Windows Server 内置 NFS 服务或第三方现代 NFS 软件），并在防火墙层面限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 TCP/UDP 111 端口（sunrpc），同时禁用不必要的 RPC 服务以减小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93923679004325&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/63f7cdb3d3ebf7bfe8ef6a2325af30a024b23325/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1349.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1349","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1349.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/175fba1f481a7f7cf5bdb5344d3c0e47af1884ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1349.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hv9m-2rcj-rh9v/GHSA-hv9m-2rcj-rh9v.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1349.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000816.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8eedf1cb11548f43d573399be49eeffcf4f32e25/1999.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0777","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0777.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0791","title":"Hybrid Networks Cable Broadband Access System 远程管理认证缺失漏洞","description":"Hybrid Networks Cable Broadband Access System 1.0 的管理接口缺乏任何身份验证机制，其使用的 HSMP 协议完全未包含认证或访问控制功能。攻击者无需任何凭据即可通过网络远程连接到管理端口，绕过所有安全验证并执行任意管理命令。CVSS v2.0 评分为 10.0，攻击向量为网络远程攻击（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需认证（Au:N），可导致完全机密性、完整性和可用性丧失（C:C/I:C/A:C）。该漏洞影响所有使用该系统的用户，攻击者可以完全控制受影响设备，进而操纵网络流量、窃取敏感数据或发起进一步攻击。\n","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0791"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-10-06T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"Hybrid Networks Cable Broadband Access System 为已停产产品，厂商未提供安全补丁。建议采取以下缓解措施：1）将设备隔离到独立管理 VLAN，通过网络分段限制对 HSMP 端口（默认 161/162）的访问；2）在边界防火墙上配置 ACL，仅允许受信管理 IP 地址访问管理端口；3）部署带外管理网关或堡垒机，对 HSMP 管理会话进行认证代理和审计记录；4）评估替代方案，迁移至支持认证机制的现代宽带接入管理系统。\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/695","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0791"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0777.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0777.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1074","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1074.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1357","title":"Netscape Communicator 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.04 至 4.7 版本（以及可能的其他版本）在多种 UNIX 操作系统中运行时，会将字符 0x8b 转换为 \"<\" 符号，将字符 0x9b 转换为 \">\" 符号。远程攻击者可在未对上述字符进行过滤的 CGI 程序中注入恶意脚本代码，当其他用户访问该页面时触发跨站脚本执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响广泛的 UNIX 平台 Netscape 浏览器用户，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至不受影响的版本或部署额外的输入过滤机制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1357"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:16Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Netscape Communicator 浏览器，迁移至 Firefox 或 Chrome 等受支持的现代浏览器。同时，Web 服务端 CGI 程序应对用户输出中的 0x8b 和 0x9b 字符进行 HTML 实体编码或过滤，防止跨站脚本攻击。由于 Netscape Communicator 已停止维护，无安全补丁可用，升级浏览器是唯一的根本解决方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93915331626185&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/63f7cdb3d3ebf7bfe8ef6a2325af30a024b23325/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1357.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1357","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1357.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/175fba1f481a7f7cf5bdb5344d3c0e47af1884ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1357.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9c